Phonon Echo Ollama extension
Copyright 2026 robit-man

Runtime source was extracted from robit-man/fine_tuning_suite at
726dace074e9f47b87f5bd3aeee1bd69ba250dd5 and adapted into the standalone
phonon_echo package. New extension and preparation code is Apache-2.0.

The Ollama patch modifies official Ollama v0.40.11 at
675150d6ad2747df1e218ef59de9194bc4a7e538. Ollama is MIT licensed;
see phonon_echo/licenses/Ollama-MIT.txt. Modifications add model import,
an Ollama-managed CPU runner, reference-audio transport, and regression tests.

Model weights are downloaded separately from Ollama or their pinned upstream
repositories. Phonon and Mimi use Apache-2.0. OpenVoice V2 uses MIT. Whisper's
model card uses Apache-2.0 and its upstream code uses MIT. Complete license
texts are in phonon_echo/licenses. The OpenVoice architecture is installed
from its pinned MIT-licensed upstream source, without optional demo packages.

